Package: censoredGP
Title: Full Bayesian Gaussian Process Regression for Censored Functional Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Adam Gorm", "Hoffmann", role = "aut"),
    person("Claus Thorn", "Ekstrom", role = "aut"),
    person("Benjamin Zeymer", "Christoffersen", role = "aut"),
    person("Andreas Kryger", "Jensen", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "aejensen@users.noreply.github.com"))
Description: Fits exact dense Gaussian process models to functional and
    longitudinal measurements with observation-specific left and right
    censoring. Full Bayesian inference uses Stan Hamiltonian Monte
    Carlo with analytical C++ likelihood derivatives. Supports hierarchical
    curves, explicit hyperparameter priors, prior predictive checks, and
    joint posterior predictions. Implements the model of Hoffmann et al.
    (2025) <doi:10.1002/sim.70277> without low-rank covariance approximations.
