Suggests: cmdstanr (>= 0.8.0), testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown,
    numDeriv, mvtnorm
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppEigen
SystemRequirements: C++17; CmdStan (>= 2.37.0) for model fitting
